'''Masquerade''' (Japanese: '''マスカレード''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Masquerade can be found in the seventh of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Masquerade will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Power of Darkness Deck==
'''Power of Darkness Deck''' (Japanese: '''あんこくのパワーデッキ''') is the deck played by Masquerade. The deck features the promotional {{TCG ID|Pokémon Card GB2|Team GR's Mewtwo|promo}}, which was created to promote the game, as well as several types of Dark Pokémon, one of which is also exclusive to this version of the game.

